<view class="{{['data-v-4fa1feca', 'container', k]}}"><view class="page-shell brief-shell data-v-4fa1feca"><view class="page-header brief-header data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="title data-v-4fa1feca">🗞️ 每日简报</text><text class="subtitle data-v-4fa1feca">每天快速了解重要新闻与热点动态</text></view><view class="toolbar-card card data-v-4fa1feca"><view class="data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="toolbar-label data-v-4fa1feca">{{a}}</text><text class="toolbar-desc data-v-4fa1feca">{{b}}</text></view><button class="refresh-btn data-v-4fa1feca" bindtap="{{d}}" disabled="{{e}}">{{c}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{f}}" class="loading data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="loading-icon data-v-4fa1feca">⏳</text><text class="loading-text data-v-4fa1feca">正在加载每日简报...</text></view><view wx:elif="{{g}}" class="error-box card data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="error-text data-v-4fa1feca">{{h}}</text><button class="retry-btn data-v-4fa1feca" bindtap="{{i}}">重新加载</button></view><view wx:else class="brief-list data-v-4fa1feca"><view wx:for="{{j}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="e" class="brief-card card data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="brief-rank data-v-4fa1feca">{{item.a}}</text><view class="brief-main data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="brief-title data-v-4fa1feca">{{item.b}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.c}}" class="brief-source data-v-4fa1feca">{{item.d}}</text></view></view></view><view class="note-card card data-v-4fa1feca"><text class="note-title data-v-4fa1feca">说明</text><text class="note-text data-v-4fa1feca">简报内容来自聚合接口并做缓存展示；热点新闻会随时间变化，点击刷新可获取最新内容。</text></view></view></view>